### Sources currently flagged for a coverage drop (#472)
### `flaggedAt` and `flagReason` are on every source response. A flagged source
### is one whose runs all SUCCEED — that is the failure being caught: the
### importer keeps working, writes the usual number of events, and the data
### quietly gets worse. The flag clears itself on the next normal run.
GET {{importer-host}}/api/admin/event-sources
Accept: application/json

